s the nights that we're never ever right","start":46.31999969482422},{"end":60.279998779296875,"text":"It's the moments, just where it begins, never really ends","start":52.2400016784668},{"end":67.08000183105469,"text":"Life has me on a blind, life has me on a blind, life has me on a beam","start":60.959999084472656},{"end":73.23999786376953,"text":"And I'm blind, blind, blind, tell me I'm blind, blind, tell me I'm blind, blind, blind","start":67.08000183105469},{"end":78.55999755859375,"text":"Yeah, I've been and I'm not at that rate at all","start":73.80000305175781},{"end":83.86000061035156,"text":"I felt like I was the night between you","start":79.55999755859375},{"end":89.9800033569336,"text":"It seems that I was day and I was day","start":83.86000061035156},{"end":96.72000122070312,"text":"A little wind, a little light, a little end","start":89.9800033569336},{"end":101.83999633789062,"text":"Can't be me, can't be friends now, it's too deep","start":96.72000122070312},{"end":106.08000183105469,"text":"And I've been me, and I've been","start":101.83999633789062},{"end":117.76000213623047,"text":"Everything, it never ends, for all of you","start":108.9800033569336},{"end":124.13999938964844,"text":"Your baby ain't gone, but I better stay with the cheddar","start":118.72000122070312},{"end":130.67999267578125,"text":"Only one thing to bring us together again, will never end","start":124.13999938964844},{"end":135.36000061035156,"text":"This love won't be getting away","start":130.67999267578125},{"end":142.8000030517578,"text":"I know what the music's called","start":138.60000610351562},{"end":148.3800048828125,"text":"I love you so, where'd the music go","start":143.47999572753906},{"end":151.55999755859375,"text":"I love you so","start":148.74000549316406}],"unlock":{"card":"card-63","fragments":10},"chartVersion":"v6_deluxe","chartReport":{"version":"v6_deluxe","bpm":129.11,"catalogBpm":91,"tempoConfidence":0,"beats":332,"bars":82,"repeatedBars":39,"povTimes